# The Day Care, on Route 1.
#
# Small on purpose: one counter, one keeper, and a pen of plants at the back.
# Every building a player can walk up to opens, and this one was the last on
# the map that did not, which reads as a door that is broken rather than a
# door that is locked.

zone daycare
name DAY CARE
size 9 8
indoor

tiles
WWWWWWWWW
WlYYYYYlW
WlKKKKKlW
WlllllllW
WBlllllBW
WBlllllBW
WlllllllW
WWWWdWWWW
end

warp 4 7 route1 16 13 south

npc keeper 4 3 south villager
  say Leave one with me and it will train while you walk.
  say It is not open for business yet. Soon.
end

npc dcvisitor 2 6 east villager
  say I left mine here a week ago.
  say I think it has forgotten me.
end

event sign 6 6
  say DAY CARE. WE MIND THEM WHILE YOU WALK.
end
